statement:
Nine existing tests failed only because student and staff due dates changed. Each was updated where R1 changes what it checks, with a comment and without weakening its intent:
- BaseTests (the head-of-queue student is due 2026-03-16);
- L02 (borrow days shifted so the same due dates and ties result);
- L04-R2 and L04-R3 (return days shifted to keep the same days late and fines);
- L07 (the notice body shows the student due date 2026-03-18);
- L10HoldPickupTests (four student/staff due dates; in one, staff copy c2 is no longer late on return).
